## QuickServersApi

### Place a QuickServer order, generating a real invoice and queuing provisioning
## Place a QuickServer order, generating a real invoice and queuing provisioning
POST https://my.interserver.net/apiv2/qs/order
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
true
Cookie: sessionid={{cookieKey}}
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}
sessionid: {{apiKey}}

{
 "server": "<number>",
 "password": "<string>",
 "os": "<string>",
 "tos": "<string>",
 "comment": "<string>"
}


### Permanently delete a QuickServer backup file from object storage
## Permanently delete a QuickServer backup file from object storage
DELETE https://my.interserver.net/apiv2/qs/{{id}}/backups?all={{all}}&file={{file}}
Accept: application/json
true
Cookie: sessionid={{cookieKey}}
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}
sessionid: {{apiKey}}

